                    Rich { "Each section is long enough that a link to it scrolls the page, which is where a sticky header can hide the first line of what it was sent to. Each section is long enough that a link to it scrolls the page, which is where a sticky header can hide the first line of what it was sent to. Each section is long enough that a link to it scrolls the page, which is where a sticky header can hide the first line of what it was sent to. Each section is long enough that a link to it scrolls the page, which is where a sticky header can hide the first line of what it was sent to. Each section is long enough that a link to it scrolls the page, which is where a sticky header can hide the first line of what it was sent to. Each section is long enough that a link to it scrolls the page, which is where a sticky header can hide the first line of what it was sent to." }
